   gts_bfbf.11427.desc: "The giantess looks down at you on the table, holding a box about the size of your head. To keep her appointment with you, she reluctantly shrunk her body to a hundred times your size to come here.\\nShe reaches out and lightly touches the box you're holding; the small box then changes to a size matching her frame. You wait expectantly for her to open it and receive the surprise you prepared.\\nShe tilts her head slightly and looks at you, as if she has read your mind. She slowly opens the box in her hands, revealing the gift you meticulously prepared for her—"
