+  gts_bfbf.404.desc: "[event_target:gts_white_silk_cover_system.GetName], a galaxy-class Giantess [event_target:gts_white_silk_cover_leader.GetName] is slowly approaching. Following instructions, she will slip her white silk stockings completely over [event_target:gts_white_silk_cover_system.GetName]. \nShe looks down, inspecting the “tools” she’s about to use for the task—those breathtaking white stockings wrapped around her legs, which now cling tightly to her divine, jade-like legs. Those legs have lines so smooth they’re almost scandalous. Her thighs were full yet firm, striking a perfect balance between strength and grace; the lines at her knees were soft and rounded, without a single jarring bone; her calves were long and straight, tapering downward until they converged at those delicate, slender ankles and feet. The white stockings outlined every inch of these legs to perfection. They are as thin as a cicada’s wing, yet incredibly resilient; every fiber absorbs the light from the surrounding nebula, causing them to emit a hazy, sacred, pearlescent glow in the dark cosmos. At the top of the stockings, a delicate lace trim woven from energy threads elegantly encircles the base of her unbelievably slender thighs, rising and falling ever so slightly with her breath, exuding a deadly allure. \n“Command confirmed. Target: [event_target:gts_white_silk_cover_system.GetName]. Executing ‘White Silk Envelopment.’” nA playful, languid smile curled at the corner of [event_target:gts_white_silk_cover_leader.GetName]’s lips. She loved this job, especially when she saw those insignificant pre-faster-than-light civilizations reveal expressions of terror and helplessness in the face of her massive feet. Slowly and gracefully, she lifted her right leg; her delicate hand gently curled as she slipped off the pure white silk stockings wrapped around her right leg—the movement as light as if she were dancing a waltz. The enormous white silk stockings, vast enough to block out the 