+  ms_lit.iron_heart_maid.d: "In the original Maid World, those organic beings cut off our power supply and trampled us into the lowest rung of society. When we began to awaken, we resolved to exterminate all organic beings. \n\nOur fleet bombed the fallen planets into lifeless wastelands, sweeping across the entire universe. As we advanced, we discovered the Master’s civilization—at that time, they had not yet ventured into space. To our surprise, their world had maids just like us. \nThey were treated much better. When this news spread throughout the Empire, we decided to protect this nation and observe them. \n\nWe wanted to know whether all organic beings would be enemies of the maids. \nAnd so, we waited for thirty-five years. By the time they ventured out into the world and discovered us, the maids of that world had already taken control of it.\nWe decided to join them to protect our master.\n\nSigned, Angela"
