+  gts_aurora.1191.desc: "§HLady Aurora, your meal is ready. Please help yourself.§!\n A mothership, towing a bowl as large as a planet, floated before Lady Aurora. Inside were stacked many small portions of food that seemed out of proportion to the bowl’s size. Since the Tiny people had not yet cultivated giant fruits and vegetables, they could only provide Lady Aurora with her main dishes in this manner for the time being; however, they had no such concerns when it came to pastries and desserts like cream cakes. \n\nHidden beneath the aroma of the dishes, the Tiny persons—who fervently worship Lady Aurora—had mingled themselves among the vegetable leaves in the bowl, longing to enter the sacred spiritual realm: Lady Aurora’s mouth. To avoid defiling her, these Tiny people thoroughly cleanse their bodies and sneak into the food during preparation and transport.\n\nEven though security protocols against them have become increasingly stringent, it remains impossible to completely prevent this phenomenon. \n\n§rThank you all, I’m going to eat now.§!\n\nThe ship severed the connection. Aurora lifted the small bowl, tilted her head back, and tipped its contents into her mouth, and the Tiny people followed, swept in along with the shredded food. \n\nThe entire contents of the small bowl quickly found their way into her mouth. Aurora closed her lips and began to chew; her mouth plunged into darkness as teeth wider than a city came crashing down. \n\nOne by one, the tiny persons burst upon contact with her teeth, being cut and crushed along with the food. The iron-like taste of blood mingled with her sweet saliva and the delicious pulp of the dish, adding a hint of savory sweetness to the meal. then her fragrant tongue swirled, pushing another piece of unchewed food—along with a Tiny person—onto the surface of her teeth. \n\nThe constant chewing caused saliva to gradually accumulate in her mouth. Aurora closed her eyes and swallowed the food pulp with satisfaction, feeling