+  gts_aurora.1192.desc: "Recently, among the most fervent admirers of the Giantess, a trend has emerged involving entering through the anus, passing through the rectum, and being digested and absorbed in the intestines to become nourishment for the body of Lady Aurora. \n\nOn the surface, they claim this allows them to become a part of Aurora’s body and align with her will, but in reality, it is merely to satisfy their sexual desires. \n\nAt the rear entrance, near Lady Aurora’s constantly contracting and relaxing anus, these tiny persons gathered excitedly. They discussed the journey ahead among themselves, completely unafraid of the fact that they would ultimately die. \n\nTaking advantage of the anus’s contractions and relaxations, they leaped in batch after batch, plunging into the rectum. Once their eyes had adjusted to the dim light, the tiny persons looked around.\n\nThe surrounding environment was vast and dark red, as if they had entered a whole new world. the intestinal walls were covered with twisted, horizontal folds that constantly squeezed and contracted back and forth. A layer of crystalline mucus coated the surface of the walls; stepping on it felt like walking on ice during a minor earthquake, so they had to crawl on all fours to move forward with relative ease. \n\nThe Tiny people were relieved that there was no accumulation of food residue in the rectum; otherwise, before they could become nourishment for Lady Aurora, they would have been swept to the surface of the excrement by the rectum’s peristalsis and expelled from the body along with it. \n\nTiny people crawled through the long rectum, scrambled over one circular segment of the colon after another—each filled with fermenting chyme—and, with the help of their tools, barely managed to pass through the ileocecal valve.\n nAfter what seemed like an eternity, the tiny people reached the final destination of their journey: the small intestine. Here, the muscular walls were covered with villi taller than they were, and the faint stench in the air had vanished, replaced by the tangy scent of buttercream cake.\n\n§H So Aurora’s dessert today is buttercream cake, after all. §!\n\nThe tiny people shed their protective suits and walked naked into the thicket of villi. As the soft villi brushed against their skin, they soon felt a burning sensation—yet it vanished as if in a dream. \n\nThe down continued to rub against their bodies, and their wriggling small intestines transformed into a warm cradle swaying back and forth. The tiny people felt their eyelids grow heavy; here, they entered Slumber, losing all sense of the outside world and drifting into a beautiful dream from which they would never wake. \n\nThen, intestinal secretions covered them, and they were broken down without any awareness. In their beautiful dream, they were transformed into nourishment for Lady Aurora."
+  gts_aurora.1193.desc: "Ever since the Planetary Decree was enacted, the areas where Lady Aurora frequently appears have been designated as off-limits, and staying away from these places has become a consensus among those living within the body. \n\nHowever, this has led some young tiny-person couples to view visiting these places as a way to express their rebellious spirit and assert their complete independence. At the same time, the thrill of defying social norms and testing the limits of life during these secret trysts has made it impossible for them to resist. \n\nIn pursuit of this thrill, the tiny persons had come here. With their hearts pounding with excitement, the tiny persons broke their embrace, gazing at each other with dazed eyes, both feeling as though they hadn’t had enough. This was their third time here, but previously they had never ventured deep into the forbidden territory; they had only dared to stay on the periphery, limiting themselves to the tops of their feet. But that level of excitement no longer satisfied them. They looked behind them, toward the tips of their white-jade-like feet—the vast space between the five soft, plump, and rounded toes. \n\nThe cute spaces between the girl’s toes already looked incredibly erotic; just the thought of making love there was enough to make the two tiny persons blush and steam rise from their heads. After exchanging a glance, they understood each other’s intentions and set off toward the spaces between her toes. It didn’t take long for them to reach the gap between the big toe and the second toe—which were each the size of a small asteroid—arriving at what felt to them like a milky-white ocean. where the surface was suffused with a faint, faint foot odor that made their whole bodies burn with heat and their minds race with desire—the more they smelled it, the more addictive it became, making them long to bury their heads in the crooks of her toes to lick the sweat and savor the delicious flesh of her toes. \n\nOne of the tiny persons, following her inner urge, pounced directly on her partner, forcefully prying open her mouth with her tongue to greedily sip her saliva, while her other hand reached beneath her partner’s body and began thrusting fiercely. Embraced, they rolled deeper into the crooks of each other’s toes, not particularly worried about any potential danger—after all, their toes had remained completely still during their previous two encounters. As they rolled ceaselessly, their bodies were smeared with arousing foot sweat and each other’s bodily fluids. The haze in their minds made them lose all sense of the outside world; they simply clung to each other fiercely, as if desperate to become one. Just a moment later, an unexpected turn of events occurred: two asteroid-like walls of flesh drew closer together. Yet the tiny persons, having lost all reason, paid no attention to the commotion outside their world, continuing to mechanically move their fingers between each other’s legs. \n\nSplash— The walls of flesh pressed together, and the two tiny persons clung to each other ever more tightly, until finally, just as they’d wished, they merged into one. As their toes rubbed and moved back and forth, they were evenly smoothed and spread out. \n\n§rMmm—§!\n\nAurora, who had just woken up, didn’t notice at all that two tiny figures had vanished without a trace under the unconscious rubbing of her little feet."
+  gts_aurora.1194.desc: "At the entrance to Lady Aurora’s pussy—another secluded path not belonging to the factory—the tiny people made their way through a thicket of coarse pubic hair, standing on her tender, pink labia minora, their surfaces glistening with sticky Love fluid. \n\nThe Tiny persons, who worshipped Lady Aurora, shed their clothes here and leaped into the dark red abyss of her vaginal canal in their most candid state. They fell onto the elastic, soft mounds of flesh lining the inner walls of her vagina; these mounds, like a trampoline, caught the Tiny persons and bounced them high into the air. \n\nOnce everyone had gathered, they pressed onward toward the depths of the little hole, along the way, some were always captured by the ravines in the vaginal walls, sinking into the soft, spongy vaginal flesh and sinking to the bottom of the ravines, never to leave again. Though they were so entranced by this that they willingly became little insects cleaning the vagina, until they were swallowed by the Love fluid and suffocated to death. \n\nAfter an unknown amount of time, the contractions of the flesh walls subsided, and finally, the last few tiny persons stood, drenched in moisture, before the cervix, which resembled a space station. \n\nTo the tiny persons’ eyes, the cervix—with its concave center and rounded outer rim—loomed so towering and majestic that it defied description, and the womb connected to the cavernous opening at its center was the very reason these tiny persons had come here. \n\nThese tiny people longed to enter Aurora’s uterus, to enter that sanctuary—even if it meant they would truly never be able to escape Aurora’s vagina again, and ultimately lose their sanity in the uterus’s Love fluid, becoming the vaginal worms that cleanse the uterus. \n\nThe distance between the opening of the uterus and the bottom of the vagina was insurmountable, and the plump outer rim of the cervix was coated with a layer of slippery Love fluid—much like a surface smeared with dish soap, making it impossible to gain a foothold. The Tiny people would climb just two steps upward before falling back down. \n\nNo one knows how many years or months passed, but these tiny people never managed to climb up. Deprived of food, they could only draw nourishment from the Love fluid, transforming into lowly worms increasingly addicted to it, scattered throughout the vaginal crevices."
