+  gts_azure_waters.2.c_custom: "This ever-changing environment and the abundance of unknown creatures are still too dangerous for us... Let someone more familiar with the area lead the way."
+  gts_azure_waters.3.desc: "§B Seele§! Guided by her memories, she arrived at the area she remembered. Ever since she fell into the Quantum Sea, the energy radiating from her surroundings had gradually seeped into her body; it seemed she had some innate, special affinity with this place. The science officer following her attempted to make contact with the world bubbles floating nearby, but as they drew closer, her form kept shrinking, and the pitch-black world bubbles seemed to stretch out endlessly. Noticing this, §B Seele§! helplessly reached out and guided her away from the edge of the world bubble, cradling her on her fingertips. “If you try to enter a world bubble, you’ll be subject to its own rules, so you’ll be transformed as well.” “Huh? Are you asking why §B Seele§! wasn’t affected? “Probably because §B Seele§! has become one with the Quantum Sea?”\nAs her size continued to grow and her senses gradually sharpened, §B Seele§! sensed a familiar presence not far from the original world bubble. Her excitement was plain to see; nothing could stand in the way of their reunion."
+  gts_azure_waters.3.a: "Surprise Bronya?"
+  gts_azure_waters.4.desc: "“Let’s get one thing straight: if you wander off and something happens, I won’t waste my time saving you.” As soon as they entered the Quantum Sea, §R§R “Seele” §!§! warned the science officers who had followed her in, determined to dedicate themselves to Advanced Research. “I’m not as well-adapted to this environment as Seele, so if anything happens to you, I won’t be able to explain it back home…” n§R «Seele» §!’s warning wasn’t without merit. Our current knowledge of the Quantum Sea is far too limited; acting rashly could very well result in unnecessary losses. For the sake of safety and efficiency, we’d be best off following her as we explore."
+  gts_azure_waters.4.a: "......"
+  gts_azure_waters.5.name: "Surprise"
+  gts_azure_waters.5.desc: "§B Seele§! shrank her body to match the size of the Bronya she perceived. Although shrinking to near her limit caused some discomfort, §B Seele§! maintained this size and crept up on Bronya to surprise her. \nMeanwhile, Bronya had undergone a similar transformation after becoming the Herrscher of Reason. Her body, now nearly 100,000 times larger, could virtually ignore any obstructing lifeforms, and the quantum shadows drifting through the void were often shattered by Bronya’s unintentional movements. After wandering aimlessly for a long time, Bronya suddenly sensed a threat behind her, but when she turned around, she found nothing out of the ordinary—just the familiar void and a few floating world bubbles. Before Bronya could let her guard down, her eyes were suddenly covered by two slender little hands. Feeling the softness behind her press tightly against her, she abandoned any thought of breaking free. \n“Guess who I am, big sis.”§ B Seele§! quietly covered Bronya’s eyes, pressed her body tightly against her, and waited silently for her sister’s answer. “Xi… §B Seele§!” Hearing that long-missed voice, Bronya couldn’t believe it and struggled to contain her excitement. “§B Seele§! I’ve finally found you, Bronya. Now, let §B Seele§! take you away from here.”"
+  gts_azure_waters.5.a: "Cool!"
+  gts_azure_waters.6.name: "White Seele: Recruiting Board Duck 2  Temporarily Discontinued"
+  gts_azure_waters.7.name: "Accident"
+  gts_azure_waters.7.desc: "After exploring for what felt like an eternity, we gathered a great deal of valuable data, but our search for §C Bronia§! still yielded no results. Just as they were about to return, “Seele” suddenly sensed danger and quickly formed a scythe to prepare for the threat. After scanning the area, we also identified the source of “Seele’s” alarm, but once she recognized the figure in the distance, she let her guard down. \n“Big Sis, it’s been a long time.” ” “Seele” sheathed her scythe and floated toward §C Bronia§!. But to our surprise, §C Bronia§! suddenly launched an attack against her. Once the smoke from the floating cannons cleared, “Seele” stood there, seething with anger. “You guys go ahead. I’ll bring §C Bronya§! si~ster~ out with me in a bit.” “Seele” threatened menacingly, so we immediately prepared to evacuate…\nAfter contacting Seele from outside the rift, we waited for quite a while. Finally, we saw “Seele” and §CBronya§! emerge from the rift together. Although we didn’t see what happened next, judging by the smug look on “Seele’s” face and the slightly guilty expression on §CBronya§!’s, we could pretty much guess what had transpired…"
+  gts_azure_waters.7.a: "huh"
+  gts_azure_waters.7.a_custom: "W...elcome?"
+  gts_azure_waters.8.name: "§CBronya§!"
+  gts_azure_waters.8.desc: "Leaving the Sea of Quantum, §C Bronya§! Finally found §B Seele§!. Now they have settled down in this universe."
+  gts_azure_waters.8.c.name: "Relationship with §R Seele§!"
+  gts_azure_waters.8.c.desc: "As another personality of §B Seele§!, §C Bronya§! is certain she would never do anything to harm §B Seele§!. We’ll work together to protect §B Seele§!"
+  gts_azure_waters.8.d.name: "Future Plans"
+  gts_azure_waters.8.d.desc: "§CBronya§! and §BSeele§! will be staying here for a long time, until we find our original world... If you need anything, feel free to ask §CBronya§!"
+  gts_azure_waters.8.e.name: "What Can You Do?"
+  gts_azure_waters.8.e.desc: "§CBronya§! She can take on many roles—it all depends on your needs."
+  gts_azure_waters_rifts_2: "The Sea of Quantum"
+  gts_azure_waters.101.c_custom: "Our current understanding of this place is still too limited; rushing into things could lead to unexpected consequences, so let's take our time and think it through."
