+  gts_hitomi.30002.b.name: "What do you mean by “short-term employment”?"
+  gts_hitomi.30002.b.response: "What I mean is, I haven’t sold myself to you. I’ll fulfill the entire §Rfifteen-year§ contract and work for you as a scientist during that time; once the term is up, this partnership will naturally come to an end. For me, that’s long enough."
+  gts_hitomi.30002.c.name: "What was that little gift you mentioned?"
