+  gts_hitomi.30003.desc: "§R Note: Currently, Hitomi Mitsuki is a temporary hire; she will leave on her own after 15 years. You can obtain her permanently by completing a special event afterward, but her level and traits during the temporary hire period will not be retained.§!\n§R Actively activating the Relic allows her to leave early and triggers subsequent events.§!"
