+  gts_trait_orangez2_desc: "“Why didn’t you get out of the way?”\n“Because I have nowhere left to retreat—I have no choice but to burn myself as fuel and fight until the very end ().”\n(Don’t worry, I won’t kill myself.)"
+  gts_trait_orangez3: "A Heavy Burden"
+  gts_trait_orangez3_desc: "With the past behind her, the burden that Ora now must bear is likely far greater than ever before. However, this was her choice, and she has successfully risen to the challenge. The heavy weight on her chest, along with her physique—which is even more imposing than that of an ordinary human—have likely become the “price” she must pay."
+  gts_trait_orangez4: "Conceptual Armor Modules"
+  gts_trait_orangez4_desc: "She’s still the Ora you remember so well. Although you know that the present-day her is just a page from the past, unlike the real thing, that “open-hearted” nature you know so well has unexpectedly deflected many conventional gunfire attacks during battle."
