she saw...\nAt the end of those two towering walls of soft white, above the planet’s dome, a familiar face was looking down at her.\n“Wenwen!?” n Kaining’s voice couldn’t travel through the vacuum, but Qinwen clearly heard it—she even tilted her head slightly, as if trying to make out the buzz of a mosquito.\nHer pale pink eyes blinked twice.\n“Mm, it’s me.” nQinwen’s voice was still gentle, but this gentleness was completely different from the one Kaining remembered. In her memories, Qinwen always spoke in a soft, quiet voice, as if afraid of disturbing something nBut now, this voice descended from the vault of the universe; every syllable made galaxies tremble, every sentence sent stars quaking. Though it was just as sweet and charming, to Kaining—standing a thousand or so meters away—it was terrifying beyond comprehension."
+  gts_qinwen.16.desc: "Kaining was held aloft by two fingers. She glanced down—Qinwen’s fingers were fair and slender, her nails neatly trimmed, and her fingertips glowed with a faint pink hue. Each fingerprint was like a canyon, and even seemed to hold traces of planetary debris.\nQinwen looked at her as if she were some amusing little creature.\n“Little Kaining is so cute.” n Kaining froze.\n“Usually so gentle and careful—who knew you were hiding something like this inside?” Qinwen smiled, her expression tinged with indulgence. “Letting your desires run wild… you’ve got what it takes to be a goddess.” n“Wenwen… you’re so naughty… suddenly getting so loud.”\nHer voice was as soft as a mosquito’s buzz.\nQinwen paused for a moment, then covered her mouth and burst out laughing. nHer eyes crinkled with laughter, and her two enormous jade feet wiggled slightly—that movement caused the Earth between her soles to crack ever so slightly. If Kaining hadn’t been held in her grasp, she would have been crushed to dust\n“I’ve always been this big.” ” Qinwen said with a smile, a touch of smugness in her voice, “It’s just that Little Kaining never noticed before.”\n“Just now, I was out in space, searching and searching, and then I realized you were inside this little planet—so I just shrunk down~” n“You… why did you get so big…?”\n“You said it yourself—this is a dream. Let’s talk about it once the dream is over.”\n“So now—”\nShe chuckled softly, her voice full of affection and playfulness.\n“It’s my turn to play~” nWith that, Qinwen brought the tiny Kaining in the palm of her hand up to her lips. To Hai Ning, those enormous lips looked no different from celestial bodies, yet she felt not a shred of pressure—only warmth and a flutter in her heart.\n “Little Kaining~ You’re so cute...”\nQinwen paused for a moment. \nThen, covering her mouth, she burst out laughing with a “heh.”\nThat laughter was as gentle as the swaying of wind chimes, yet it made the entire universe tremble ever so slightly. Her eyes crinkled with laughter, and even her two enormous jade-like feet wobbled slightly—that movement caused the Earth between her soles to roll gently, cracking the surface with fine fissures. Magma seeped from the cracks, only to be quickly solidified by the universe’s freezing cold. \nIf Kaining hadn’t been cradled in the palm of her hand, she too would likely have been crushed into fine dust, just like those cities. \nBut at this moment, she was simply being gently cradled, suspended before those pale pink eyes—tiny and blushing.\n\nShe lifted Kaining a little closer, so close that their noses were almost touching. Those pale pink eyes curved into two crescent moons, reflecting Kaining’s flustered expression.\n“Just a moment ago,” she said, “I was out there in the cosmos, searching and searching, searching and searching—” Qinwen drew out the last syllable, as if telling a bedtime story, “I found out you were on this little planet, so I shrank down and came down to find you.”\n“Shrunk… shrunk…?”\nKaining froze. \nShe looked down at the finger Qinwen was holding—a finger thicker than the Milky Way, with fingerprints deeper than canyons, and bits of planetary debris still lodged between its ridges.\n“Is this what you call ‘shrinking’?”\nQinwen seemed to sense her confusion and gave a soft chuckle.  nShe spoke casually, yet her tone carried a hint of playfulness, as if she were seeking praise.\nKaining opened her mouth, wanting to say something, but no words came out. \n“You… why did you get bigger…”\nShe finally managed to squeeze out.\nQinwen blinked.\nA mischievous gleam flashed in her pale pink eyes.\n\n“I’ll tell you once the dream is over.” ” Qinwen lifted her up to her face and gently nuzzled her with the tip of her nose—the movement was as gentle as a kitten’s rub, but to Kaining, it felt as though an entire mountain range had come crashing down and then lifted her back up again, except that it was nothing but tenderness, Her warm breath brushed over Hai Ning’s entire body, tickling and soothing.\n“So now—”\nQinwen drew out the last syllable, her eyes brimming with laughter and tenderness.\n“It’s my turn to play.” nWith that, she gently cradled little Kaining in the palm of her hand and lifted her to her lips.\nHer lips, as vast as planets, slowly drew near. \nIn Kaining’s eyes, those lips were no different from a celestial body—soft, moist, and tinged with a faint pink; with every breath, a warm tide gently swept over her body.\nBut strangely enough, \nEven though they were so huge, so overwhelming, Kaining felt no fear at all.\nOnly the warmth that comes from “leaning on” someone~\nOnly the shy, fluttering excitement between two women~\nOnly the burning heat that rushed to her cheeks as her heart raced~"
+  gts_qinwen.17.desc: "“Little Kaining~”\nQinwen called out to her softly, her sweet voice spilling from her lips.\n“You’re so cute…”\nThen, she gently pressed her lips against hers—a kiss that enveloped Kaining’s entire body.\nIt was as gentle as a petal drifting down nBut to Kaining, it felt as if the entire sky were kissing her. A warm sensation spread from her forehead throughout her whole body, carrying Qinwen’s faint, distinctive scent—making her feel dizzy and limp, as if she were soaking in warm water\nShe instinctively closed her eyes, and the radiance grew even brighter, and Kaining’s body slowly grew larger; on a scale of tens of thousands of kilometers, Qinwen’s kiss became even sweeter nQinwen’s lips lingered there for a very, very long time before slowly pulling away.\nWhen Kaining opened her eyes again, what met her gaze were those soft, pale pink eyes, brimming with a gentle smile, just inches away, overflowing with tenderness.\n “Your face is so red~ You’re shy, aren’t you?”\nQinwen said softly, her tone carrying a hint of mischief, but mostly indulgence.\nKaining opened her mouth to protest, only to realize her face was indeed burning hot.\n“I’m—I’m not…” \nHer voice was as soft as a mosquito’s buzz.\nQinwen chuckled softly and gently brushed Kaining’s cheek with her fingertip—the gesture was incredibly tender, as if she were caressing a priceless treasure.\n“Little Kaining.” n“Hmm…?”\n“You were so bold just now when we were stepping on the planets.”\nQinwen tilted her head to look at Kaining.\n“So why are you like this now, just because I kissed you?”\nKaining’s face flushed even redder. \nShe wanted to say, “That’s different,” to say, “You suddenly got so big,” to say, “I’m not ready yet”—but all the words got stuck in her throat, and in the end, she could only manage:\n“… You’re so naughty... naughty.”\nAfter saying that, Kaining mustered her courage, took a big leap, and pressed her lips against those giant, planet-like lips.\nHer voice was soft and sweet, tinged with a hint of petulance. \nQinwen froze for a moment, then smiled mischievously, sticking out her huge red tongue to intertwine with Kaining’s tiny pink one, splashing sweet saliva all over little Kaining’s face. \nThen she laughed even more joyfully. \nThat laughter echoed through the universe, gentle and bright. She gently cradled Kaining against her chest and rubbed her cheek against the girl’s, just like a kitten rubbing against its owner. \n“Little Kaining~ You little rascal~”\nShe whispered, her tone brimming with affection. \n“My very own little rascal~”\nKaining felt dizzy from her nuzzling, curling up in the warmth of her palm, her face as red as a ripe tomato.\nShe wanted to say something, but found that she… nnot hate this at all\nIn Fact, she kind of liked it\nShe liked being cradled like this\nShe liked being nuzzled like this\nShe liked hearing her call her “Little Kaining” in that voice so gentle it made her want to cry\n nEven though the difference in their sizes was like a chasm, to them, it was just a sweet little cuddle\n nQinwen looked at the tiny figure in the palm of her hand—cheeks flushed, eyes glistening, and her body still covered in Qinwen’s own sweet saliva\nHer heart melted\n“Little Kaining~”\nShe called softly\n“Hmm…?” nKaining lifted her head and met those pale pink eyes, smiling like stars.\nThen she saw that enormous face getting closer and closer, her warm breath brushing over her entire body—those lips drew near once more, but this time, they didn’t stop.\n“Eh…?” \nBefore Kaining had time to react, the whole world suddenly went dark, leaving only a warm, soft sensation and the ever-present scent of a young girl’s skin.\nShe was enveloped.\nQinwen’s delicate lips gently closed, wrapping her entire body in that warm, soft embrace. There was no pressure, just a gentle embrace\n\nAll around her were warm, soft walls with a faint fragrance—the inside of Qinwen’s mouth. Light seeped in through the gap between her lips, casting an ambiguous pink glow... She could feel Qinwen’s breath, one breath after another, a warm tide washing over her entire body\n“Mmm…”\nShe wanted to say something, but the sound was muffled in her throat and wouldn’t come out\nThen—\nSomething gently brushed against her. \nSoft, warm, and wet n—it glided over the soles of her feet, up her calves, and slowly upward, licking away all the urban debris clinging to her socks, stroke by stroke\nThat tongue felt too big for her—like a warm river, slowly flowing over her body. The tip of the tongue gently curled up the hem of her skirt, then quickly let go, like a mischievous child testing the waters. Then the broad surface of the tongue pressed against her, lifting her entire body and gently turning her over\nKaining lay face-down on that warm, soft surface, her mind a blank. \nShe could even feel the tiny taste buds on the tongue’s surface; with every lick, it felt ticklish and warm, making her whole body go weak."
+  gts_qinwen.18.desc: "“Um… Wen… Wenwen…”\nShe finally managed to squeeze out a few words, her voice soft and sweet, with a slight tremor.\nA soft chuckle came from outside.\nThe laugh was muffled, yet still gentle. \nThen the tongue moved again.\nThis time, it was slower and more meticulous. The tip of the tongue gently parted her strands of hair, gliding slowly from her forehead to her cheek, lingering for a moment by her ear before tracing down her neck. Every inch of her skin was attended to, every sensitive spot gently touched. \nKaining curled up in that warmth, her face flushed so red it seemed it might bleed.\nShe wanted to hide, but there was nowhere to hide.\nShe was surrounded by soft walls; beneath her was a warm, fragrant tongue, and every breath carried Qinwen’s scent.\n“That’s… that’s too much…” \n“Naughty...”\nShe muttered softly, her voice muffled.\nNo sooner had the words left her lips than the tip of that tongue gently tapped her nose. \nAs if to say: So what if it’s too much?\nKaining froze.\nThen she suddenly broke into a sweet smile.\nHer eyes stung a little as she smiled—even though she was in a place where the other person only needed to exert the slightest effort to sever her head from her body... To Kaining, however, there was only endless warmth.... In this hypocritical world, only she could bring her a touch of natural, sincere warmth. \n—This little rascal. \nEven now, with her head held in his mouth, she felt no sense of oppression. \nOnly warmth\nOnly tenderness\nOnly Qinwen’s everlasting love\n“…Wenwen.”\nShe called out softly.\nThat massive tongue paused for a moment, as if it had heard her.\n“I’m fine.” n Kaining whispered, her voice soft and gentle\n“You… can… go a little further… it’s okay…”\nNo sooner had the words left her mouth than her face flushed again\nThere was a moment of silence outside\nThen that tongue suddenly curled up, gently enveloping Kaining’s entire body. \nHer long skirt was lifted by the tongue, and the secrets unique to a young girl were slowly revealed by Qinwen...\n“Uh-oh?! Wenwen, you—?” nBefore Kaining could even utter a gasp of surprise, that jade-like tongue began to tease and lick her tiny flower...\n“Huh...”\nAs the girl she loved most dearly, she would naturally never hurt her—but... For Kaining, this was indeed a bit too much to handle. \nAlready flushed, Kaining could no longer control herself. She covered her honeyed slit with both hands, trying to fend off Qinwen’s advances, but given the difference in their sizes, her clumsy resistance was futile, Qin Wen’s fragrant tongue still drew closer to the entrance of Kaining’s slit\nThough teased by that enormous jade tongue, she felt not a trace of pain—only pleasure\n“Mmm! Stop! I can’t take it anymore!”\n“Huff... ♡”\nAs Qinwen’s massive tongue continued to tease her, the petite Kaining could no longer resist the onslaught of desire and finally climaxed inside Qinwen’s mouth.\nHer juices flowed endlessly; as they came into contact with Qinwen’s tongue, they smeared all over Kaining’s body... .\nThe scent of saliva and her own juices stimulated her senses... making it impossible for her to stop... Finally, she raised her hand to caress her own delicate slit\n♡\n“Mmm... huff, puff...” nHer body grew increasingly feverish, and her consciousness gradually surrendered to the dominance of pleasure... until she fainted."
+  gts_qinwen.19.desc: "“Mmm... that feels so good... Huh? What... are you back already? Wenwen?” n Swept away by a flood of pleasure, Kaining slowly opened her eyes to find herself in the antique shop she knew all too well. The scene from moments ago had vanished like a dream—though it had been truly terrifying... That sensation... And the slight dampness down there... made it all feel so real...\nSeeing Qinwen, who was her normal size, standing across from her helped her calm down a lot.\n“Phew, Wenwen, I just had a weird dream...”\n“That wasn’t a dream~ Just look down at yourself.” n Kaining lowered her head slightly and saw that her panties were stained with thin, sticky silver threads\n“Huh?!” nHer face instantly flushed as red as a tomato. Kaining hurriedly covered herself there, but then, thinking back on her various actions in the dream, she let her guard down again\n“Wen… Wenwen, w-what’s going on here? How did you get so big?”\n“Of course~ This isn’t a dream~ It’s just a little prop.”\n“Still, you were actually that open-minded back then.”\n“Uh-oh! Don’t say that.”\n“I’m going to say it anyway~” n“Mmm…”\n“Huh~? You actually kissed me so eagerly~?”\n“Mmm, mmm, mmm, mmm, mmm”\n“Little Kaining~ Stop kissing me! I can’t breathe!” n“Hmph~ You rascal.”\nKaining pressed her lips against Qinwen’s fiercely, then kissed her again and again until Qinwen’s mind went blank and her own head felt light. Their lips remained pressed together in a tense standoff for a few seconds, until Kaining finally sensed something was off and shyly pulled away from Qin Wen’s fragrant lips.\n“Oh my~ Little Kaining’s getting shy.”\n“Naughty! Stop teasing me. You still haven’t told me why you got so big.” n“It’s just a little trinket a guest gave me—a miniature city where you can step into a dream… and then you can do whatever you want.”\n“Wow—that’s really amazing…”\nAmid the gentle whispers of the two adorable girls, Hanling’s ordinary yet fulfilling day finally came to a close."
