+
+  gts_evt_random.030100.name: "Giant Sperm Collision"
+  gts_evt_random.030100.desc: "A few days ago, our outpost detected a group of massive, unidentified objects hurtling at high speed from the edge of the [event_target:gtsra_random_futa_event_planet.GetName] galaxy. Our team of scientists racked their brains but were unable to determine what they were. \n nBut now, the truth is clear: they are undoubtedly giant sperm. Both their appearance and the data returned by our probes confirm that these unidentified objects are giant sperm—each one at least five times the volume of the colony §H[event_target:gtsra_random_futa_event_planet.GetName]§! , and the source is likely some futa Giantess—perhaps §Y[event_target:gtsra_random_futa_event_leader.GetName]§!?\n\nIf the computer’s calculated trajectory is correct, there’s a high probability that their path will pass through our colony. We must do something; we cannot sit idly by and watch our hard-won colony be destroyed by a swarm of sperm that can only move forward."
+  gts_evt_random.030100.a: "Order the local garrison to open fire, diverting the sperm from its path"
+  gts_evt_random.030100.b: "The Giantess's sperm is far more valuable than a tiny colony—don't worry about it."
+  gts_evt_random.030100.c: "If you don't have the money, there's nothing we can do—have [event_target:gtsra_random_futa_event_leader.GetName] compensate for the collision damage."
+  gts_evt_random.030101.name: "The giant sperm has veered off course"
+  gts_evt_random.030101.desc: "We're safe now, but even the sperm are so huge—it's hard to imagine how terrifying §H[event_target:gtsra_random_futa_event_leader.GetName]§'s current size must be. We need to keep her sexual urges under control."
+  gts_evt_random.030101.a: "Obey orders without question; warn her that she must clean up after she finishes."
+  gts_evt_random.030101.b: "All things considered, her sexual desire is still more important."
+  gts_evt_random.030102.c: "All things considered, her sexual desire is still more important."
+  gts_evt_random.030102.name: "Giant Sperm Collide with the Colony"
+  gts_evt_random.030103.name: "Giant Sperm Collide with the Colony"
+  gts_evt_random.030102.desc: "The sperm collided with the colony §H[event_target:gtsra_random_futa_event_planet.GetName]§!, causing massive destruction. Fortunately, our people had taken cover in advance, so there were no major problems. Based on chemical analysis, the owner of the sperm has been identified as §Y[event_target:gtsra_random_futa_event_leader.GetName]§! However, there was an unexpected bonus: the impacted area gave off a lustful scent that stirred the senses."
+  gts_evt_random.030102.a: "A misfortune may turn out to be a blessing in disguise."
+  gts_evt_random.030102.b: "Warn her that she must clean up after she finishes."
+  gts_evt_random.030103.desc: "The sperm collided with the colony §H[event_target:gtsra_random_futa_event_planet.GetName]§!, causing massive destruction. Fortunately, our people had taken cover in advance, so there were no major problems. Based on component analysis, the owner of the sperm has been identified as §Y[event_target:gtsra_random_futa_event_leader.GetName]§!. However, there was an unexpected bonus: the impacted area emitted a lewd scent that stirred the senses. \n\n§Y[event_target:gtsra_random_futa_event_leader.GetName]§! explained that this was caused by her failing to wipe properly after relieving her sexual urges a few days ago, and she is willing to compensate for the damages."
+  gts_evt_random.030103.a: "Issue her a ticket and warn her that she must clean up after herself next time."
+  gts_evt_random.030103.b: "Dealing with the Giantess's sexual desires is far more important than the colonies; as long as she's compensated, it doesn't matter what happens to her."
