+  gts_random_storm.12.desc: "The investigation into the source of the Sweat Tide was a success! \nOur scientists have discovered a twisted spatial rift at the center of the sweat tide. This type of rift connects two distant points in space. Since the two ends of the rift are not the same size, the flow of matter passing through it is magnified or shrunk by hundreds of thousands of times due to the spatial distortion—which explains the origin of this vast sweat tide. In other words, the galaxies currently being swept up by the Sweat storm are, at this very moment, nestled in the armpit of a Giantess. \nAfter venturing through the spatial rift, our research vessel found itself beneath the armpit of an 11- or 12-year-old Loli. The faint, alluring scent of a developing young girl’s sweat was enough to render us researchers—now shrunk hundreds of thousands of times smaller—unconscious within seconds. For safety’s sake, we had no choice but to shut down the air exchangers and rely entirely on the ship’s internal circulation. Through positioning, the research vessel determined that it was located in a residential area of one of our country’s colonies. \nShe was currently asleep in bed, though the covers had been kicked off by her restless limbs. Her tank top hung loosely, revealing her little belly and a blue children’s bra, her armpits wide open. Warm sweat was continuously welling up from deep within her skin; upon contact with the outside air, it slowly evaporated and rose, leaving a faint layer of moisture on the skin beneath her armpits. To us, however, this “thin layer” was already deeper than the oceans of our homeworld. \nIt seemed this young woman was naturally prone to heat and sweating, and during the local summer, her sweat became even more profuse. \nThe Imperial Administrative Department has already ordered the colonial government to upgrade the cooling systems throughout the residential area. At the same time, several stealth warships equipped with condensation bombs will temporarily station themselves under her armpits to monitor her sweat secretion in real time and gradually reduce the volume of sweat mist passing through the spatial fissure. \nOur scientists predict that this rift is unstable and will close completely within a few months to a few years. However, the sweat storms that have already poured into the Milky Way through the portal can only be left to time to resolve."
+  gts_random_storm.13.desc: "The investigation into the source of the Sweat Tide was a success! \nOur scientists discovered a twisted spatial rift at the center of the sweat tide—a rift that connects two distant regions of space. Since the two ends of the rift are not the same size, the flow of matter passing through it is magnified or shrunk by hundreds of thousands of times due to the spatial distortion, which explains the origin of this vast sweat tide. In other words, the galaxies currently being swept up by the Sweat storm are, at this very moment, nestled in a certain woman’s armpit. \nHowever, upon passing through the spatial rift, the research vessel’s location signals indicated they were on our Empire’s homeworld—more precisely, within the residence of the homeworld’s Giantess leader. \nFurther verification revealed that... [event_target:gts_random_storm_leader_target.GetName]—the storm affecting several galaxies originated from the Sweat secreted by her body. \nWatching this gigantic goddess leisurely stretch and browse through documents while reclining on the sofa, we couldn’t be sure whether this was merely a coincidence or a new way for her to use her divine power to play tricks on the mortal world. Fortunately, we’re small enough right now that she hasn’t spotted us yet. nBack in the main world, we broached the subject with [event_target:gts_random_storm_leader_target.GetName] in a roundabout way. She seemed quite surprised—perhaps she hadn’t expected that she could destroy the galaxy in this manner, forcing countless living beings to submit to her bodily secretions. Let’s hope this experience doesn’t awaken any unsavory interests in her.\nAt least she’s cooperating with the work; the Administrative Department will dispatch a large number of personnel and machines to construct water channels on her skin, diverting the sweat from her body to other locations. She will also reduce her outdoor activities during this time, quietly waiting for the storm she created to subside. The Public Relations Department will also impose news restrictions to prevent the spread of statements such as “[event_target:gts_random_storm_leader_target.GetName] extinguishes stars with her sweat”—statements that, while factually accurate, would damage her personal image. \nOur scientists predict that this fissure is unstable and will close completely within a few months to a few years. However, the sweat storm that has already been channeled into the Milky Way through the portal can only be left to time to resolve."
+  gts_random_storm.14.desc: "The investigation into the source of the Sweat Tide was a success! \nOur scientists have discovered a twisted spatial rift at the center of the sweat tide. This rift connects two distant regions of space. Since the two ends of the rift are not the same size, the flow of matter passing through it is magnified or shrunk by hundreds of thousands of times due to the spatial distortion—which explains the origin of this vast sweat tide. In other words, the galaxies currently being swept up by the Sweat storm are, at this very moment, nestled in the armpit of a Giantess. \n\nIt turns out she’s one of our country’s slaves. \nWe’ve already moved her to a safe location, and \nsome people who’ve learned the truth have even begun attempting to contact this female slave. \nWe can’t let more people find out about this."
