+  gts_random_storm.25.desc: "The investigation into the source of the Urine Tide was a success! \nOur scientists discovered a twisted spatial rift at the center of the urine tide—a rift that connects two distant points in space. Since the two ends of the rift are not the same size, the flow of matter passing through it is magnified or shrunk by hundreds of thousands of times due to the spatial distortion, which explains the origin of this vast urine tide. In other words, the galaxies currently being swept up by the urine storm are, at this very moment, residing within a woman’s genitalia. \nHowever, upon passing through the spatial rift, the research vessel detected a location signal indicating they were on our Empire’s homeworld—more precisely, within the residence of the homeworld’s Giantess leader. \nFurther confirmation revealed that... [event_target:gts_random_storm_leader_target.GetName]—the storm affecting several galaxies originated from the remaining droplets of urine in her urethra. \nThis giant goddess was currently stretching lazily, leaning back on the sofa and perusing documents. Meanwhile, seeping through her short skirt and panties, the droplets of urine in her urethra flowed erratically with her slightest body movement, Our spacecraft, having taken off in a hurry, witnessed the moment these residual droplets merged into a spatial rift. One can imagine that soon another wave of urine will surge forth, engulfing several unfortunate planets. We really couldn’t be sure whether this was merely an accident or a new idea she’d come up with to toy with the human world using her divine powers. Fortunately, we’re small enough right now that she hasn’t spotted us yet. \nBack in the main world, we broached the subject with [event_target:gts_random_storm_leader_target.GetName] in a roundabout way, She seemed quite surprised—perhaps she hadn’t expected to be able to destroy the Milky Way in this way, forcing countless living beings to submit to her bodily secretions. We hope this experience doesn’t awaken any unsavory hobbies in her. \nAt least she’s cooperating with the effort. The Administrative Department will dispatch a large number of mechanical units into her urethra to construct flood barriers and drying devices, in order to prevent more urine from flowing into the Milky Way. She will also limit her outings during this period, quietly waiting for the storm she created to subside. The Public Relations Department will also impose news restrictions to prevent the spread of statements such as “[event_target:gts_random_storm_leader_target.GetName] extinguished a star while urinating”—statements that, while factually accurate, would damage her personal image. \nOur scientists predict that this rift is unstable and will close completely within a few months to a few years. However, the sweat storm that has already been poured into the Milky Way through the portal can only be left to time to resolve."
