+  gts_random_storm.30.name: "A Whisper Storm has been detected!"
+  gts_random_storm.30.desc: "Scanners have detected a cosmic storm carrying whispers from the Void approaching our borders. We have now named it <Storm Name>.\nSuch storms cause devastation to all colonies and prevent our fleet from using emergency hyperspace. It is strongly recommended that all colonies in its path take immediate precautionary measures.\nThe storm is colorless and formless, but all sentient beings within its reach will hear the murmuring whispers of a Giantess from beyond the heavens. The heavy, sorrowful emotions emanating from her cause the gravity of the entire galaxy to shift, causing buildings and fleets to collapse and become inoperable under their own weight, while even stars emit a stronger gravitational pull than usual, as if unwilling to let the planets and the Tiny persons on them escape her control. \nSome scientists could not believe that the Giantess’s murmurs could create a storm on the scale of an astronomical phenomenon, and they strongly demanded an investigation into the storm’s origin."
