+  gts_random_storm.50.name: "Foot Odor Storm Detected!"
+  gts_random_storm.50.desc: "Scanners have detected a cosmic storm carrying a strong odor of Giantess’s foot odor approaching our border. We have now named it <STORM Name>.\nSuch storms cause damage to all colonies and prevent our fleet from using emergency hyperspace. It is strongly recommended that all colonies in its path take immediate precautionary measures. \nExposure to the intense odor of a Giantess’s feet can easily cloud the minds of our crew; therefore, to ensure safe navigation, all fleets within the storm must prioritize power allocation to active communication systems, rendering cloaking fields ineffective. However, for workers at mining stations, filtered foot odor serves as their best work stimulant. Our observation stations can also use this opportunity to observe the interesting behaviors of indigenous civilizations as the entire globe is engulfed by this Giantess foot odor disaster. \nSome scientists find it hard to believe that the foot odor of Giantesses could generate a storm on the scale of an astronomical phenomenon, and they are strongly demanding an investigation into the storm’s origin."
