+  gts_random_storm.65.desc: "Excretion!\nThe investigation into the source of the Fart Hole Storm has been a success! \nOur scientists discovered a distorted spatial rift at the eye of the storm. This type of rift connects two distant points in space; since the two ends of the rift are not the same size, the flow of matter passing through it is magnified or shrunk due to the spatial distortion, which explains the origin of this raging storm surge. Our scientists predict that this rift is unstable and will close completely within a few months to a few years. \nAfter making thorough preparations, our research vessel took advantage of a brief lull in the storm to pass through the spatial rift. But all we could see was darkness; the surrounding space, however, was filled with a warm, damp scent of female body sweat, as if it hadn’t been ventilated in a long time. \n“Ugh, aaaah, I’m so exhausted—”\n“Today was really tiring.”\n“What’s Teacher Xiao Ba trying to do, assigning so much work!”\nThe entire space suddenly shook violently; it seemed the owner of this space was changing clothes with others in the locker room. As they took off their clothes, our field of vision cleared, and we confirmed our location via coordinates: we were on the body of a high school girl on one of our nation’s colony planets, with the spatial rift suspended not far from her buttocks. After stripping down, they took a quick shower; during which we had to maneuver the spaceship deep into the girl’s anus to avoid the flood. \n“Woo—that feels so good.” n“Milk tea, milk tea—”\n“Hey, Lemon, are you hungry?”\n“Of course I’m hungry.”\n“Well then, how about we go out for ramen tonight? I saw a great noodle stand near the school the other day!” n“Huh? I kind of feel like going...”\n“Then let’s go tonight!”\nThe other two girls chatted excitedly, while the girl we were staying with sat off to the side, quietly reading a magazine. \n“Oh, by the way, hey, Ju! You were peeking while we were taking a shower just now, weren’t you?”\n“Whoa?! I… I wasn’t looking.” nAlthough it was nowhere near loud enough for her classmates to hear, we clearly heard the girl let out a fart from the shock. Though it quickly dissipated into the air, under normal circumstances, those gases might have been intercepted by her underwear and eventually seeped into a spatial fissure.\n“You liar, you were definitely peeking.” ”\n“I... why would I need to... peek?”\n“Hey, Little Ju, when we were rinsing our chests just now, you didn’t even react when I called you.”\n“Sodayo.”\n“Uh... uh... um...” n“If you want to look that badly, I’ll let you have your fill~”\n“Waaah! You—you guys can’t just do whatever you want just because you’ve got big boobs! Waaaaaah————”\nAfter that, the girl let out several farts in a row amid her panic and struggle. It seems that due to this girl’s nervousness and malnutrition, her anus would occasionally and involuntarily release a bit of stench. Once these gases accumulated inside her underwear, they would escape through spatial fissures, evolving into a fart storm that swept across several galaxies. \nWe eventually dispatched an elite medical team to reside permanently within her intestines to provide care, and—in the name of school-wide mental health education—helped this student manage her psychological stress, hoping to bring her little habit under control within a few months. However, regardless of our efforts, the environmental impact of her unconscious behavior on the Milky Way will continue for years to come."
